2e7a.mp3","beach/audio/4714dddf-7279-41fa-8808-dc1fdacbc677.mp3","beach/audio/0b0454f6-e4c3-4769-8f59-5a9c0221564a.mp3","beach/audio/baca6ff3-f0e9-4c3b-9823-9c7d89fcd8d1.mp3","beach/audio/27a7c8ee-cc8f-4ff1-bfef-5a34f3920d00.mp3","beach/audio/8329fffd-8d13-4de7-9a3f-f00f1b1a2175.mp3"],"winnie/Say_Short":["beach/audio/7b021c79-7b1d-42a4-9473-499cb544745f.mp3","beach/audio/f26c9ce8-c42a-45b7-b202-6b321732d1b4.mp3","beach/audio/a7fd01d5-d181-4cad-a39e-38a7ceb92c1b.mp3","beach/audio/d240ed3e-0cc3-4e62-9ef9-5b193a2355a5.mp3","beach/audio/7c62e6cb-c90a-40c1-9df4-79f1ac132ff3.mp3","beach/audio/1967b484-8ec0-4c93-ab17-d1d3e3d518f4.mp3","beach/audio/47a181a5-4767-446d-a4ab-ead910e1515b.mp3","beach/audio/6ef53e9c-f664-4f7b-9915-4e211ebda8e9.mp3","beach/audio/9bd3de02-3b49-4230-b17d-c2d0afa88323.mp3"]},"narratives":{"BEACH_INTRO_ZOMBOSS":[{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Yo beach bums! Don't flip your lid.","zh":"嘿，沙滩哥们儿！淡定点儿。"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Med"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"But have you noticed that Chomper and Bikini Zombie have been ultra cozy lately?","zh":"但你发现了吗？大嘴花和比基尼僵尸最近简直亲密过头了。"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Could a beachside plant-zombie romance be in bloom?","zh":"所以……这段海滨植物与僵尸的浪漫史是否已经处于萌芽阶段？"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Speaking of which, how sure are you of Chomper's loyalties?","zh":"说到这个，你对大嘴花的忠诚度有多大把握？"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I can't help but notice ... that plant has the appetite of a zombie.","zh":"我不禁注意到……那株植物的食量和僵尸一样惊人。"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Chew on that land lovers! Later dudes!\nDr. Zomboss","zh":"陆地上的家伙们，好好琢磨一下吧！回头见了，各位！\n僵尸博士"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"A plant-zombie romance? Penny ... my mind is BLOWN!","zh":"植物和僵尸的浪漫？潘妮……我震惊到世界观崩塌了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"User Dave, do not jump to conclusions. I suggest something more productive.","zh":"用户戴夫，请不要妄下结论。我建议做些更有建设性的事。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Let us jump into the action!","zh":"接下来就让我们实践吧！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"}],"BEACH_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"A plant-zombie romance? That's just craaaazy!","zh":"植物和僵尸的浪漫？这也太——疯狂了吧！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SHOUT","Lines":{"en":"And I know a thing or two about craaaazy!","zh":"我还知道一两个——疯狂的事情！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I concur. I suspect Dr. Zomboss was attempting to sow seeds of discontent.","zh":"我同意。我怀疑僵尸博士只是在煽风点火。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"From now on, we are the only ones sowing seeds around here!","zh":"从今以后，这里只有我们能“播种”！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Totally bogus! Little do you know what I have in store for you!","zh":"简直胡扯！你们根本不知道我为你们准备了什么“惊喜”！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"The seeds of destruction have been planted! Brace yourselves for a wipe out!","zh":"毁灭的种子已经播下！准备迎接彻底溃败吧！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"But for now, I gotta split. Catch you dweebs later!","zh":"但是现在我得撤了，回头再找你们这些书呆子算账！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Long"}],"BEACH_33_INTRO":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"You heard that? Weird roars came from the far water.","zh":"听，海那边传来了奇怪的吼叫声。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Waves of zombies diving underwater detected.","zh":"侦测到成群的僵尸潜伏在水下，"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"It'd not be a good idea to play in the water here.","zh":"在这里玩水不会是个好主意，"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Better go to other timelines 'til our plant alliance becomes stronger.","zh":"我们可能需要退回到其他时间线，等我们的队伍更加壮大时再回来。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"}],"BEACH_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Look at this beeeeautiful beach!","zh":"看看这美丽的沙滩！"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Short"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"It's got everything a growing plant needs!","zh":"这里有我们正在长身体的植物们需要的一切！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"Sun, sand and lots o' water!","zh":"阳光，沙子，还有用不完的水！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Caution, User Dave. My sensors indicate there are zombies on your beach...","zh":"注意，用户戴夫。我的传感器检测到沙滩上有僵尸……"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"... and far too much water. It will overwhelm the plants.","zh":"……还有太多的水。这会把植物淹坏的。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"No problem-o! We'll just lay down some Lily Pads.","zh":"没啥大碍！我们只需要种下一些莲叶。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Then the other plants can ride the waves!","zh":"其他的植物就能玩冲浪了！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"Or as the vernacular of this era goes: They can \"hang ten\".","zh":"或者用这个时代的俗语来说：他们可以“挂十”。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"Right on, Penny. Right on!","zh":"说得对，潘妮！完全正确！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"BEACH_INTRO_TIDES":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"User Dave, data suggests that we should beware the tides.","zh":"用户戴夫，数据显示我们需要注意沙滩上的海水。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"When the tide comes in, it'll be a WIPE OUT for our plant friends?","zh":"你是指当海浪涨起的时候，我们的植物会被淹死吗？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Indeed. But the tide line indicates how high the water will rise. Plan accordingly.","zh":"正确的。但是海岸线会告诉我们海浪最多能涨到哪里。你可以依此做好计划。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"The tide comes in, the tide goes out. Who can explain it?","zh":"海水又能前进又能后退，这怎么解释得通？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"That would be science, User Dave.","zh":"交给科学吧，用户戴夫。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"}],"BEACH_INTRO_CHOMPER":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"When fighting zombies from the deep...","zh":"当我们对抗僵尸时，尤其是那些来自深……"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"...we need a plant with the appetite of a shark.","zh":"……我们会需要一个胃口和鲨鱼一样好的植物。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"I catch your drift, Penny. You're talking about Chomper!","zh":"我懂你意思，潘妮。你指的是大嘴花吧！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Indeed. His sharp teeth could turn the tide of battle.","zh":"正确。他锋利的牙齿能扭转战局。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Hey, I have an idea too! We could call this Chomper Week!","zh":"嘿，我也有个好主意！我们可以把这周称为大嘴周！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"If we must, User Dave. If we must.","zh":"如果有必要的话，用户戴夫。有必要的话。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"}],"BEACH_INTRO_BOWLING":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"My research indicates that the sport of bowling experienced a heyday during this era.","zh":"根据我的调查，保龄球运动在现在是火热的运动。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"Are you thinking what I'm thinking, Penny?","zh":"你和我想得一样吗，潘妮？"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"I find your thought process indecipherable, User Dave.","zh":"用户戴夫，我发现你的思维过程令人难以解读。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I was thinking that Bowling Bulbs would make excellent allies here.","zh":"我在想，保龄泡泡会成为我们绝佳的帮手。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Huh. I was thinking how much I love wearing bowling shoes.","zh":"喝，我想的是我终于能穿上保龄球鞋了。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"So many colors ... right there on my feet!","zh":"五彩斑斓……印在我的脚上！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"BEACH_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_ALT":[{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Dudes, like, you're totally in for it now!","zh":"兄弟，你真的上道了嘛！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Med"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"The Deep Sea Gargantuars have their slimy sights on you.","zh":"你进入了深海巨尸黏滑的视线。"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Med"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"You can run! You can swim!","zh":"你可以逃！也可以潜！"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Short"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"But you can't escape their scaly grip!","zh":"但你无法躲开它们的鳞片。"},"Animation":"Idle","Voice":"zombossicon/Say_Med"},{"Character":"zombossicon","Action":"NPC_EXIT"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Ugh. That dude is totally gnarly.","zh":"那家伙真是酷毙了。"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Short"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"He is also quite unpleasant, User Dave. Quite unpleasant.","zh":"他也会真的把我们毙了的，用户戴夫。是真的毙了。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"}],"BEACH_INTRO_GUACODILE":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"I tell ya, Penny, these surf-loving zombies are the pits!","zh":"跟你说啊潘妮，这些冲浪僵尸真是糟透了！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Analyzing the phrase: \"The pits\" ...","zh":"正在分析未知词汇：“糟透了”……"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"Hmmm. Pits. Very interesting. User Dave! You are a genius!","zh":"嗯。糟透了。非常有趣。用户戴夫！你是个天才！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"I am?","zh":"我是吗？"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Short"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"No. No you are not. However, you have given me an idea.","zh":"不。你不是。但是你启发了我。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Guacodile! This plant fights zombies with pit-like projectiles.","zh":"鳄梨！这株植物用口水弹攻击僵尸。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"And he employs a powerful bite as well.","zh":"他还能释放有力的咬合攻击。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Plant him on the front lines. You'll see.","zh":"把他种在前线，你就会见识到了。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"}],"BEACH_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Alert! I've detected a strange statue of surfing-era significance.","zh":"警报！检测到一个具有冲浪时代意义的奇怪雕像！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Well lookie there! It's a tiki statue. With crazy eyes.","zh":"快看这个！是个提基石像，眼睛长得超疯狂。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Analysis indicates this tiki could inflict a terrifying challenge upon any who follow it.","zh":"分析表明，这座提基神像可能会给任何追随者带来可怕的挑战。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"So you're saying that a tiki torture awaits? Get it? A tiki TORCH-er?","zh":"所以你是说“提基酷刑”在等着我们？懂了吗？提基“酷”刑？"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"User Dave, I must say, your pun is...\nTORCH-er-ous.","zh":"用户戴夫，我必须说，你的双关让我的处理器……\n“酷”热难耐。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"}],"BEACH_INTRO_HOMINGTHISTLE":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"Whew! Fighting zombies that arrive in waves AND tides isn't easy.","zh":"呼！打败那些乘着浪来的僵尸真是劳累。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"You know what we need, Penny? An ally with a lot of 'tude!","zh":"你知道我们现在最需要什么吗，潘妮？我们需要一株全能的植物！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"And by 'tude, I mean attitude. In case you need translation.","zh":"说到全能，我指的是全场都能打。免得你又需要翻译。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"Then I suggest we call upon Homing Thistle.","zh":"那我推荐导向蓟上场。"},"Animation":"Say_Small","Voice":"winnie/Say_Short"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"I believe he has this 'tude you speak of.","zh":"我确信这就是你想要的全场都能打。"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Say_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"His eyes! Intense! He can shoot the zombies a real mean look.","zh":"他的眼神！太犀利了！简直能用眼神狠狠射杀僵尸。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"More importantly, he can shoot deadly darts that home in on their target.","zh":"更重要的是，他能发射致命的子弹，死死朝着最靠近我们的家的僵尸。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"Two painful blows for the price of one! Radical!","zh":"一击双痛，买一送二！太厉害了！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Med"}],"BEACH_INTRO_BANANA":[{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"NPC_ENTER"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"SAY","Lines":{"en":"User Dave. Please note the line of Banana Launchers.","zh":"用户戴夫，请注意那一列香蕉火箭炮阵线。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Say_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"EXCITED","Lines":{"en":"They appear to need our protection!","zh":"看上去他们需要我们的保护！"},"Animation":"Say_Medium","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Med"},{"Character":"crazydave","Action":"PLAYFUL","Lines":{"en":"Let's get to it! After all, bananas are a very a-PEELING fruit!","zh":"让我们开始吧！依我看，香蕉会把僵尸的皮剥下来！"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"crazydave/Playful_Long"},{"Character":"winnie","Action":"TIRED","Lines":{"en":"User Dave, if I had a head, I would be shaking it right now.","zh":"用户戴夫，假如我有头的话，我一定会对你摇头的。"},"Animation":"Say_Long","Voice":"winnie/Playful_Long"}]},"ui":{"note_beach":{"image":"beach/ui/5d199d7c-6617-4df0-9df6-985b739a059f_f9941.webp","width":950,"height":600,"insets":[0,0,0,0],"name":"beach"}}}
